adhaścordhvaṃ suṣumnāyāḥ sahasradalasaṃyutam |
raktaṃ śvetaṃ ca sāhasradalasthaṃ śaktibhiryutam ||

ūrdhvādhomukhamīśāni karṇikākesarānvitam |
śaktirūpaṃ mahādevi kulākulamayaṃ śubham ||

