tasya madhye mahāyonistrikoṇākārarūpiṇī |
suṣumnā yonimadhyasthā tasyā mūle maheśvari ||

adhaḥpadmaṃ sahasrāraṃ karṇikākesarānvitam |
taijasaṃ ratnasaṃdīptaṃ taddalasthitaśaktibhiḥ ||

pratikiñjalkasaṃsthābhiḥ śaktibhiḥ saṃvṛtaṃ priye |
karṇikāmadhyato devi kuladevī ca saṃsthitā ||

tatpadmordhvaṃ suṣumnāyā madhye tvekāṅgulopari |
padmamaṣṭadalairyuktamaṣṭagranthisamanvitam ||

raktaṃ sukarṇikopetaṃ raktakiñjalkaśobhitam |
granthyagrasthatriśṛṅgaṃ ca brahmāṇyādyaṣṭabhairavaiḥ ||

aṣṭapatrasthitagranthisthitavāmādiśaktibhiḥ |
tadanyaśaktibhiścaiva śṛṅgasthābhiḥ samāvṛtam ||

tanmadhye kaulaśaktyā tu sevitaṃ ca smaret tataḥ |
ekāṅgulapramāṇordhvaṃ ṣaḍdalaṃ kulapaṅkajam || iti |

