tanuśuddhikaraṃ param | tanoḥ ṣaṭtriṃśattattvātmanaḥ śuddhiṃ 
paracitparyavasānalakṣaṇāṃ karoti | ata eva paramutkṛṣṭamitara(-)nyāsebhyaḥ || 3/41 - 42 ||

	śrīcakranyāsaprakāramāha (-)

caturasrādyarekhāyai nama ityādito nyaset || 3/42 ||
dakṣāṃsapṛṣṭhapāṇyagrasphikkapādāṅgulīṣvatha |
