sacūlīmūlapṛṣṭheṣu vyāpakatvena sundari |

      caturasrādyarekhāyai namaḥ iti mantreṇa ādito 
dakṣāṃsapṛṣṭhādicūlīpṛṭhāntasthāneṣu daśasu vyāpakatvena nyaset | dakṣāṃsasya 
pṛṣṭhaṃ paścādbhāgaḥ | sacūlīmūleti | mūlaṃ śirasaḥ purastādbhāgaḥ | pṛṣṭhaṃ 
śirasaḥ paścādbhāgaḥ | sphigeva sphikkam ūrusandhiḥ | spaṣṭamanyat || 3/42 -44 ||

