vimarśaśaktau tvayi prasannāyām (-) tatra tatrākṣamārgeṇa 
caitanyaṃ vyajyate prabhoḥ (ślo. 114) iti vijñāna(-)
bhairavabhaṭṭārakoktarītyā sarvapratyayamayatā(yā)mupagatāyāṃ 
