śivaśakti(-)melāpanamudrayetyarthaḥ | cakradevatāḥ 
caturasrādibaindavāntanavacakra(-)nivāsinīḥ 
prakāśavimarśasamarasībhūtāḥ(,) tarpayet(,) (ityarthaḥ) | 

pradānaistarpaṇaiḥ samyag viśuddhairamṛtātmabhiḥ |
mahāhantīkaromīdaṃ viśvaṃ havyavapurdharam || (su. vā. 39)

      ityabhiyuktavacanoktarītyā parasmin layaṃ bhāvayedityarthaḥ || 
3/190 ||

tarpaṇasādhanāni vastūnyāha (-)

madyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ devyai tu vinivedayet || 3/190 ||

